 "briefing": "# Canva Briefing: 16 October to 15 November 2026\n\n## Summary\n\nNo dated, verifiable changes at Canva in the 30-day window (16 October to 15 November 2026) could be confirmed. Research did not retrieve any source pages or news reports for the period. This gap reflects a failure to access sources, not confirmation that Canva was inactive. Before the meeting on 17 November 2026, the primary sources below should be checked directly.\n\n## 1. News\n\nNo verified news items for the window were found. Canva's official newsroom and blog were not accessed, so no dated announcements could be confirmed. Reuters, Bloomberg, TechCrunch, and The Australian Financial Review coverage was also not retrieved. No rumored or unconfirmed reports were identified.\n\n## 2. Product Launches\n\nNo verified product launches, feature releases, or pricing changes dated within the window were found. Canva's release notes and product update pages were not successfully reviewed, so this category remains unverified rather than confirmed empty.\n\n## 3. Hires and Departures\n\nNo verified executive appointments, senior hires, departures, or board changes were found for the window. Leadership pages, company announcements, and executive LinkedIn profiles were not checked. No unconfirmed personnel moves were identified.\n\n## 4. Deals\n\nNo verified acquisitions, partnerships, investments, funding or share sales, or customer and channel deals were found for the window. Partner press releases and regulatory or company filings were not checked. No rumored or unconfirmed deals were identified.\n\n## Recommended Verification Before the Meeting\n\nThe following primary sources should be reviewed directly, filtered to 16 October through 15 November 2026:\n\n- [Canva Newsroom](https://www.canva.com/newsroom) [1]\n- [Canva Blog](https://www.canva.com/blog) [2]\n\n## Open Questions for Canva\n\n1. Which product launches, feature releases, or AI updates shipped between 16 October and 15 November 2026, and how should customers and partners prepare for them?\n2. Have there been any changes to senior leadership, go-to-market teams, or regional leadership in the past 30 days that we should be aware of?\n2. Are there any partnership, channel, or customer deals that were recently signed or are expected to be announced soon, and how might they affect our work together?\n\n## Sources\n\n[1] Canva Newsroom: https://www.canva.com/newsroom\n[2] Canva Blog: https://www.canva.com/blog",
